      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TROUBLE IN ME (9) missed the placings two runs back then did a great job to finish 3.5 metres back in second despite breaking in the run over 1740m at West Wyalong a week-and-a-half ago. Draws out a little on the second line and may need luck at some point. Facing a tougher assignment but he is up to the task. BILLS SWAN SONG (8) has had two runs this prep and is yet to finish in the top three. Added to the sequence last time over 2260m at Bathurst, finishing 12 metres away from the winner in fifth. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. Taking on a better line-up this time but he is good enough to play a major role. VINNYSGAL (11) cannot be ruled despite the tricky draw. Best efforts give her a definite winning chance. OUR PURPLE PEARL (4) is better than her last-start eighth over 1609m at Menangle.",
